I waited long for the 'big' update from today with Colony Wars. The developers wanted to make a nicer and better UI/UX. It is really bad that they failed. Oké it looks nicer, there are some special effects and a discard counter. In return the android app is unstable, feels slow, moving your cards does not work that well in comparison as the old app. Then to the steam version, it is slow, moving cards does not work well, the animations are not even smooth (while running at 30fps an a full blown game laptop). The "3d" view seems to give a headache.
So I prefer that we get the old design back for fast good card gameplay!!
So because of the update i do not recommend this game any more..
